exports[`screen reader mode, through a reply, a tool, and a prompt 1`] = `
"JamCLI, project project, session <session>
You: read the notes
Tool done: read_file notes.txt, N ms
JamCLI: It says alpha.
You: list
Tool asking: run_command ls













Permission needed: Allow run_command ls?                 Escape denies and stops
ls
Default mode asks before tools that run commands.

1: Allow once
2: Allow this session   run_command(ls)
3: Allow this project   run_command(ls) · .jamcli/config.local.json
4: Deny, continue
5: Deny with feedback
Up/Down pattern 1/2
Status: default mode, ollama:fake-model, context N%, no sandbox, waiting for
"
`;

